  "title": "Vertiv Announces Integrated Manufacturing and Engineering Center in Monterrey, Mexico, to Address Increasing Demand",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today announced plans for a major new facility in Monterrey, Mexico, that will include a manufacturing plant, state-of-the-art test lab, and a global business services (GBS) office. The addition will help the company proactively address the increasing demand for Vertiv products and services.",
